  "prompt_mode": "short_sentence_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nAll of the \"#1 Dad\" mugs in the world change to show the actual ranking of Dads suddenly. \n\nCaleb and his son were drinking coffee and milk when his \"#1 Dad\" mug changed to show his actual dad ranking. It showed that his rank was pitiful. It was so pitiful, in fact, that he was rated in the bottom billion of dads. His son asked him if that was accurate.\n\n\"No, of course not!\" Caleb said with a shaky voice. He did his best not to spit his coffee out after seeing the trail of zeros following a six. He wished that his son did not notice. \"I'm just going to set that on a different shelf.\"",
